---
title: Traffic Light State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Red

    Red : Stop traffic
    Green : Go - allow traffic
    Yellow : Prepare to stop

    Red --> Green : timer expired
    Green --> Yellow : timer expired
    Yellow --> Red : timer expired

    classDef stopState fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#cc0000,stroke-width:2px
    classDef goState fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#00cc00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef cautionState fill:#ffffcc,stroke:#ffaa00,stroke-width:2px

    class Red stopState
    class Green goState
    class Yellow cautionState
